<div class="bg-base-100 min-h-screen">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 sm:py-24 space-y-16">
    <section class="text-center space-y-6">
      <span class="badge badge-primary badge-lg">Coming soon</span>

      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-base-content leading-tight">
        Stop guessing whether your business idea will work.
      </h1>

      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-base-content/70 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Built for entrepreneurs and small business owners who don't want to
        spend months and savings on an idea that was never going to work.
        Chat with an AI agent mesh that turns your idea into a full business
        viability assessment: competitor analysis, market diagnosis, SMART
        objectives, a financial picture for your first months, and a
        concrete path from zero to MVP.
      </p>

      <div>
        <a href="#waitlist" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
          Get early access
        </a>
      </div>

      <div id="waitlist" class="pt-6">
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-base-300 shadow-lg bg-base-100 p-6 sm:p-8 max-w-md mx-auto text-left">
          <div class="text-center space-y-2 mb-6">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-base-content">Join the waitlist</h2>
            <p class="text-base-content/70">
              We're not open yet. Leave your email and we'll let you know the
              moment you can try it.
            </p>
          </div>

          <%= if @signed_up do %>
            <div class="alert alert-success">
              <span>Thanks — you're on the list! We'll be in touch soon.</span>
            </div>
          <% else %>
            <.simple_form
              for={@form}
              id="waitlist-signup-form"
              phx-change="validate"
              phx-submit="save"
            >
              <.input field={@form[:email]} type="email" label="Email" placeholder="you@example.com" />
              <.input
                field={@form[:country]}
                type="select"
                label="Where would you use this?"
                options={@country_options}
              />
              <.input
                field={@form[:discount_code]}
                type="text"
                label="Discount code (optional)"
                placeholder="If you have one"
              />
              <:actions>
                <.button phx-disable-with="Joining...">Join the waitlist</.button>
              </:actions>
            </.simple_form>
          <% end %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-base-content">How it works</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-base-300 p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-base-content">1. Tell us your idea</h3>
          <p class="text-base-content/70 text-sm">
            Describe your product idea in a conversation, no forms or slide decks.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-base-300 p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-base-content">2. The agent mesh gets to work</h3>
          <p class="text-base-content/70 text-sm">
            Specialized agents analyze competitors, size the market, and frame
            SMART objectives for your idea.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-base-300 p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-base-content">3. Get your financial picture</h3>
          <p class="text-base-content/70 text-sm">
            A realistic view of costs and revenue for your first months in business.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-base-300 p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-base-content">4. Walk the path to MVP</h3>
          <p class="text-base-content/70 text-sm">
            A concrete path from zero to MVP, plus how to iterate once you launch.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="rounded-lg bg-base-200 p-6 space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base-content">
        Grounded in Europe's recovery and digitalization framework
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base-content/70 text-sm">
        Our assessments are built with the same lens used across the EU's
        <span class="font-medium">NextGenerationEU</span>
        recovery funds, Spain's
        <span class="font-medium">ipyme.org</span>
        SME support programs, and the
        <span class="font-medium">
          Plan de Recuperación, Transformación y Resiliencia
        </span>
        digital-transformation framework — so your business case speaks the
        same language funders and support programs expect.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
